# Homework 2 – Dual-LED PWM Control with OLED Monitoring

**Course:** Embedded IoT Systems
**Name:** <Your Name> | **ID:** <Your ID>

An ESP32 fades two LEDs using two different PWM frequencies (LEDC peripheral) and shows each LED's live duty cycle and configured frequency on an SSD1306 I²C OLED. Tested in Wokwi and on physical hardware.

